How to handle structures, chunks transitioning and generating in simulatedChunks

We should be able to generate a structure in Simulated or unsimulated chunks.
1. Simulated
   Structure blueprint is fully generated, and the seed is stored on successful generation.
   It is then marked as "under construction" or "completed" and based on this, will display different LOD mes
      Under construction - Display generic scaffolding mesh
      Completed - Display LOD mesh from the full blueprint data.
   After mesh is generated in simulated, data is discarded. We only need to know the structures plot dimensions.
2. Full
   Generated as currently is done. Store full data.

CHUNK NAV GENERATION

1. Chunk becomes "wants active" and loads data
2. All nested containers become "wants active" and loads data
  - Nested containers become "fully active" once all dependend chunks are "wants active"
  - Chunks becomes "fully active" once all nested containers are "wants active"